IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q20-ACCOUNT-VALIDATION.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ACCOUNT-NO PIC X(15).
01 WS-LENGTH PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-NO
    COMPUTE WS-LENGTH = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACCOUNT-NO))
    IF WS-LENGTH = 10
        IF WS-ACCOUNT-NO(1:10) IS NUMERIC
            DISPLAY "VALID"
        ELSE
            DISPLAY "INVALID"
        END-IF
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "INVALID"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
